OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASinn Fein will co-operate with PSNI
OL,4,Ainvestigation over Drumcree protest,
OL,5,Asays McDonald
OL,6,
OL,7,FMary Lou McDonald has said that
OL,8,F"there's no question with us
OL,9,Fco-operating with any process that will
OL,10,Funfold".
OL,12,FMcDonald and Northern Ireland's First
OL,13,FMinister Michelle O'Neill are among
OL,14,Fthose who have attended the protest,
OL,15,Fwhich police have described as
OL,16,Funnotified and "therefore illegal".
